{"type": "message", "id": "ef50d8f5", "parentId": "c50297a6", "timestamp": "2026-04-07T18:24:13.502Z", "message": {"role": "toolResult", "toolCallId": "call_f812e8ecce744a5fb1f68124", "toolName": "web_search", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\n  \"query\": \"\\\"penile cancer\\\" annual cases United States incidence number\",\n  \"provider\": \"brave\",\n  \"count\": 3,\n  \"tookMs\": 1003,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"brave\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"541e8718ef93ecbc\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nKey Statistics for Penile Cancer | American Cancer Society\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"541e8718ef93ecbc\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.cancer.org/cancer/types/penile-cancer/key-statistics.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"611a26588013f8fc\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nLearn about key statistics for penile cancer, including how common it is, who is most affected, and the outlook for those with a diagnosis. ... In the United States, it&#x27;s diagnosed in <strong>fewer than 1 in 100,000 men each year</strong>, and it accounts for fewer than 1% of cancers.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"611a26588013f8fc\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"January 13, 2026\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.cancer.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3d82fabaa5466f65\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nPenile cancer - Wikipedia\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3d82fabaa5466f65\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Penile_cancer\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"284b55af6d30667c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nPenile cancer is a rare cancer in developed nations, with annual incidence varying from 0.3 to 1 per 100,000 per year, accoun